### BookDB S1 API — Human-runnable HTTP examples
###
### Usage:
###   1. Start the dev stack: make compose-app-up
###   2. Create an API key (one-time local admin command):
###        BOOKDB_DATABASE_URL="postgres://bookdb:bookdb@127.0.0.1:5432/bookdb?sslmode=disable" \
###        go run ./cmd/bookdb key create --name "dev-key" --scope "catalog:read"
###      Note the secret (shown once).
###   3. Replace {{api_key}} below with your secret.
###   4. Open this file in JetBrains HTTP Client or use curl.

@base_url = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@api_key = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SECRET

### Get a canonical work (Dune)
GET {{base_url}}/works/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### List editions for Dune
GET {{base_url}}/works/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/editions
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Get an expression
GET {{base_url}}/expressions/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222221
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Get an edition (print, has ISBN)
GET {{base_url}}/editions/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333331
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Get an edition (audio, no ISBN)
GET {{base_url}}/editions/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Get a person (Frank Herbert)
GET {{base_url}}/people/44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444441
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### List works for a person
GET {{base_url}}/people/44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444441/works
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Get an organization (Ace Books)
GET {{base_url}}/organizations/55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555551
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Resolve a unique ISBN (ebook)
GET {{base_url}}/resolve?namespace=isbn13&value=9780441013597
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Resolve an ambiguous ISBN (claimed by two editions)
GET {{base_url}}/resolve?namespace=isbn13&value=9780441172719
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Resolve a work-level identifier (Open Library)
GET {{base_url}}/resolve?namespace=openlibrary&value=OL1234567W
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Resolve an unknown identifier (not_found)
GET {{base_url}}/resolve?namespace=isbn13&value=9999999999999
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

### Missing key (401)
GET {{base_url}}/works/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Invalid key (401)
GET {{base_url}}/works/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
X-API-Key: not-a-real-key

### Unknown work (404)
GET {{base_url}}/works/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

